sequenceDiagram
  actor O as Operator
  participant UI as Browser dashboard
  participant API as FastAPI
  participant DB as SQLite
  participant MON as Monitoring service
  participant CDSE as CDSE STAC/Process API
  participant AN as Analysis service
  participant AL as Alert service
  O->>UI: Click Check now
  UI->>API: POST /api/areas/{id}/check-now
  API->>DB: create MonitoringRun
  API-->>UI: 202 Accepted + run id
  API->>MON: background execution
  MON->>CDSE: STAC search
  CDSE-->>MON: acquisition metadata
  MON->>DB: save metadata/run status
  opt credentials + rasterio installed
    MON->>CDSE: request imagery
    MON->>AN: preprocess and compare pair
    AN-->>MON: analysis/finding candidates
    MON->>AL: create alerts if threshold met
    AL->>DB: persist case, finding, alert
  end
  UI->>API: read areas/cases/alerts
  API->>DB: query persisted records
  API-->>UI: JSON dashboard data
